<p>Returns whether or not a character has a disease
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> Disease_HasDisease(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oCharacter,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nDiseaseID<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oCharacter<dd>the Creature to check<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nDiseaseID<dd>the Disease to check for. If -1, it will return TRUE if ANY disease is present.
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>TRUE if the Creature has the Disease; otherwise FALSE
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Core%20Game%20Resources" title="Core Game Resources">Core Game Resources</a>.<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Sys%20disease" title="Sys disease">sys_disease</a>
</p>
